7
00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:17.945
so that you attend to this particular location in space.

8
00:00:17.945 --> 00:00:21.150
(upbeat music)

9
00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:21.983 line:15%
And yet,

10
00:00:21.983 --> 00:00:24.200 line:15%
