00:37:51.570 --> 00:37:54.220
and then we were in constant communication with them.

1003
00:37:55.320 --> 00:37:57.940
As they were binned into groups,

1004
00:37:57.940 --> 00:38:01.080
we had one group do a particular type of breathing

