00:38:26.260 --> 00:38:27.920
So it's two inhales followed by an exhale,

1020
00:38:27.920 --> 00:38:30.230
two inhales followed by an exhale, but for five minutes,

1021
00:38:30.230 --> 00:38:32.570
which is a pretty long time to engage in that pattern,

