00:38:37.490 --> 00:38:39.230
which we call cyclic hyperventilation.

1026
00:38:39.230 --> 00:38:41.271
So deliberately for five minutes,

1027
00:38:41.271 --> 00:38:42.800
(Huberman breathing heavily)

1028
00:38:42.800 --> 00:38:44.890
really taking their body and brain into a heightened state

1029
00:38:44.890 --> 00:38:49.339
of arousal with some limited breath holds every so often.

1030
00:38:49.339 --> 00:38:50.400
And then we had another group

1031
00:38:50.400 --> 00:38:52.220
that did that sort of traditional box breathing,

1032
00:38:52.220 --> 00:38:55.440
inhale hold, exhale hold for equivalent amounts of time.

1033
00:38:55.440 --> 00:38:58.130
And the basic takeaway from this study

1034
