00:39:36.620 --> 00:39:39.130
For right now it's just been the US, not outside the US.

1052
00:39:39.130 --> 00:39:41.680
We also could monitor people different ages,

1053
00:39:41.680 --> 00:39:42.820
different backgrounds,

1054
00:39:42.820 --> 00:39:45.380
oftentimes harder to get to come to Stanford

