They're not involved in pattern vision,

2515
01:35:48.480 --> 01:35:50.790
they're involved in gauging how much light there is

2516
01:35:50.790 --> 01:35:52.203
in our overall environment.

2517
01:35:53.140 --> 01:35:53.973
In the evening,

2518
01:35:53.973 --> 01:35:56.180
a lot of people now know to dim their screens,

2519
01:35:56.180 --> 01:35:57.882
dim the lights, but if possible,

